c","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"HTTPDestination","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"HTTPDestination","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/httpdestinations\/httpdestination","identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination","kind":"symbol"},"doc://MatomoEncoding/documentation/MatomoEncoding/MatomoBatchEncoder":{"type":"topic","title":"MatomoBatchEncoder","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/BatchEncoder","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" of Matomo’s bulk tracking API, so an "},{"code":"HTTPDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"send events to a Matomo installation’s "},{"code":"POST \/matomo.php","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/matomoencoding\/matomobatchencoder","identifier":"doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding\/MatomoBatchEncoder","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MatomoBatchEncoder","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MatomoBatchEncoder","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/Sensitive":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sensitive","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"Sensitive","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A property value that a destination reads only through the record it arrived in, and not at all","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"once the record is redacted.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/events\/sensitive","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Sensitive","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Sensitive"},"doc://MatomoEncoding/documentation/MatomoEnc